WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
I don't want to exploit others

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,700
Doesn't mean others don't want to exploit me

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,180
I must have enough force

4
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,580
So powerful that others dare not offend me

5
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,980
Don't dare to plot against me

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,110
Is classmate Chen An at home?

7
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:13,710
I'm here to discuss cooperation with you

8
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,110
Classmate Chen An

9
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:17,870
You seem to be in trouble

10
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,750
Those few people were rejected by you just now

11
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:21,550
They all looked bad when they left.

12
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,510
I'm afraid I'll hate you in my heart

13
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:24,630
Let's cooperate

14
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,070
I can help you share the pressure

15
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,920
so

16
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,520
future classmates

17
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,440
I'll give you a way to cooperate

18
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,060
See if you can accept it

19
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,900
My talent is very strong

20
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,980
You can exchange it for a few hundred gold coins.

21
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,220
And the conditions for upgrading my room door to Level 4

22
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,940
Almost satisfied

23
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,300
as long as i want

24
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,940
The door can be upgraded to level 4 today
